        "prompt":  "{\n  \"poster_type\": \"Whimsical overloaded doodle illustration\",\n  \"style\": \"Highly detailed cartoon illustration, pop-surrealism doodle art, clean and expressive line art, vibrant flat colors with soft shading, vintage comic vibe, isolated on a textured off-white paper background.\",\n  \n  \"context\": \"A chaotic, fun, and highly exaggerated surreal scene of a classroom supervision session focused on Coaching \u0026 Mentoring, highlighting close interaction between a teacher and an educational supervisor (ศึกษานิเทศก์) to improve teaching practices in a Thai school.\",\n\n  \"visual_elements\": {\n    \"base_vehicle\": {\n      \"description\": \"A stylized, slightly distorted Thai classroom environment acting as the central anchor of the composition. The classroom appears dynamic, layered, and overflowing with collaborative teaching and learning energy.\"\n    },\n\n    \"the_crowd\": {\n      \"characters\": \"Thai teacher, educational supervisor (ศึกษานิเทศก์), and students in school uniforms\",\n      \"action\": \"The teacher and educational supervisor are engaged in visible coaching interaction—leaning together over lesson plans, pointing at student work, discussing strategies, and giving real-time feedback. The supervisor may be guiding gently while the teacher reflects or adjusts teaching. Around them, students are actively participating—group discussions, presentations, hands-on learning—creating a lively and responsive classroom atmosphere.\"\n    },\n\n    \"top_element\": {\n      \"description\": \"Dominating the top of the composition is a large symbolic coaching element such as a glowing lightbulb connected with arrows or speech bubbles, representing feedback loops, reflection, and professional growth.\"\n    },\n\n    \"props_and_chaos\": {\n      \"description\": \"Fill every empty space with coaching and mentoring tools such as annotated lesson plans, observation checklists, sticky notes with feedback marks, arrows showing improvement cycles, speech bubbles, reflection icons, and assessment rubrics. Include playful micro-details like mini versions of teacher and supervisor discussing inside thought bubbles, or stars and checkmarks floating to symbolize progress and encouragement.\"\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"lighting_and_background\": {\n    \"background\": \"Plain, slightly textured cream/off-white paper background to make the colorful illustration pop. No background scenery.\",\n    \"lighting\": \"Flat illustrative lighting with subtle drop shadows directly underneath the classroom structure to ground it.\"\n  },\n\n  \"restrictions\": {\n    \"no_cluttered_background\": \"Keep the background completely empty. All the chaos must be confined to the classroom and the characters.\",\n    \"art_style_lock\": \"Must look like hand-drawn digital illustration, NOT 3D render, NOT photorealistic.\"\n  }\n}",
