        "prompt":  "{\n  \"poster_type\": \"Surreal 3D miniature vertical spiral diorama\",\n  \"style\": \"Photorealistic 3D render, isometric-like perspective, highly detailed miniature aesthetic, clean bright studio lighting, soft shadows.\",\n  \n  \"context\": \"A surreal vertical diorama built around a continuous upward-spiraling path, showcasing the cultural flow of the Lanna Songkran water blessing ceremony (Rod Nam Dam Hua). The structure tells a story from preparation at the base to the respectful ritual at the top in a seamless, symbolic way.\",\n\n  \"visual_elements\": {\n    \"core_structure\": \"A single continuous, winding spiral path that acts as the main framework. The spiral wraps around a central Lanna-style wooden pavilion core, creating multiple distinct vertical levels with traditional architectural details.\",\n\n    \"bottom_level\": \"Preparation scene: villagers preparing scented water (น้ำอบ), arranging flower garlands, folding traditional fabrics, and organizing ceremonialขันโตก trays. It sits solidly on a clean, round base with subtle natural elements like banana leaves and flowers.\",\n\n    \"middle_level\": \"The core reveals an open cross-section of a traditional Lanna household interior. Inside, intricate details show family members preparing offerings, pouring scented water into bowls, and arranging ritual items with care and respect.\",\n\n    \"top_level\": \"Ceremonial moment: younger people respectfully pouring scented water onto the hands of elders seated gracefully. The environment is calm, refined, and symbolic of gratitude and blessing. The spiral path ends seamlessly into this sacred interaction space.\",\n\n    \"giant_figures\": \"Emerging behind and above the top level are two giant, hyper-realistic human figures representing an elder and a younger participant. They are engaging in a gentle water blessing gesture, reinforcing the cultural meaning. Their scale makes the entire spiral structure below look like a delicate ceremonial model.\",\n\n    \"props_and_details\": \"Populate the spiral path with ceremonial items such asขันน้ำอบ, flower garlands, silver bowls,ขันโตก trays, woven textiles, and small trees or tropical plants. Include miniature people in traditional Lanna attire interacting naturally at each level.\"\n  },\n\n  \"lighting_and_background\": {\n    \"background\": \"A completely plain, seamless off-white or very light gray studio backdrop to make the detailed 3D structure stand out.\",\n    \"lighting\": \"Bright, even studio lighting simulating soft daylight. Highlight wood textures, fabric folds, water reflections, and floral freshness to create a premium miniature model feel.\",\n    \"color_palette\": \"Soft ivory, warm gold, natural wood brown, floral pastel tones (jasmine white, marigold yellow, soft pink, leaf green)\"\n  },\n\n  \"restrictions\": {\n    \"absolute_no_text\": \"CRITICAL: DO NOT render any text, words, letters, numbers, logos, or typography anywhere in the image. Keep all surfaces and signs completely blank.\",\n    \"no_floating_objects\": \"Everything must be physically attached to the spiral structure, the central core, or the base.\"\n  }\n}",
