        "prompt":  "Create a high-resolution vertical 3D character illustration in a stylized Pixar-meets-designer-toy aesthetic.\n\nMain character:\n“Lanna Soul Kitchen” — depicted as a tall, slim, slightly exaggerated Pixar-style 3D character inspired by a traditional Northern Thai (Lanna) chef.\nThe character should embody the identity of a master Lanna street-food and cultural cuisine artisan.\nMaintain iconic visual elements of Northern Thai culinary culture:\n- traditional indigo mor-hom clothing\n- handwoven pha khao ma fabric\n- rolled sleeves\n- wooden cooking utensils\n- charcoal-grill atmosphere\n- calm but skillful chef posture\nTranslate all features into clean, simplified, blocky designer-toy proportions with soft sculpted geometry.\nThe character must remain immediately recognizable as a Lanna chef culture icon, shown in full-body view with expressive personality and warmth.\n\nPose:\nUse a natural but expressive stance.\nThe chef may:\n- hold a traditional Northern Thai cooking spoon\n- present a bowl of khao soi\n- adjust a charcoal grill\n- carry a woven basket of herbs\n- stand proudly with calm confidence\nHead angle, hand gesture, and posture should communicate hospitality, craftsmanship, and cultural pride.\n\nBackground:\nAutomatically choose a vivid, bold, high-saturation solid color inspired by Northern Thai culinary identity.\nRecommended tones:\n- spicy chili red\n- turmeric yellow\n- smoky orange\n- herbal green\n- deep indigo\n- roasted charcoal brown\nThe background should feel flat, clean, graphic, and striking — like a luxury conceptual food-culture exhibition poster.\nAvoid gradients.\nAvoid dull cinematic gray.\nThe floor may use a closely related tone with subtle reflective texture.\nThe environment remains minimal, endless, and uncluttered.\n\nLighting:\nUse one strong directional light source from one side or upper angle.\nThis light should create a sharp, enlarged symbolic shadow behind the character.\nLighting must feel graphic, dramatic, and intentional.\n\nKey Concept — Shadow as spiritual projection:\nThe shadow behind the chef must NOT replicate the human body.\nInstead, the shadow becomes a symbolic projection of the “spiritual world” of Lanna cuisine and Northern Thai cultural identity.\n\nThe shadow should transform into a surreal symbolic composition inspired by:\n- rising aromatic smoke\n- traditional Lanna patterns\n- flames from charcoal grilling\n- giant chili silhouettes\n- mortar and pestle forms\n- mountain contours of Northern Thailand\n- elephant motifs\n- temple roof silhouettes\n- swirling noodle forms\n- herbal leaves and spice clouds\n\nThe shadow must visually embody:\n“LANNA SOUL KITCHEN”\n\nThe symbolic shadow should feel poetic, cultural, emotional, and visually powerful.\nIt must become the true conceptual core of the poster.\n\nTypography:\nPlace the spiritual-world keyword as the main poster text:\n\n“LANNA SOUL KITCHEN”\n\nUse elegant minimalist typography:\nclean serif or modern sans-serif depending on mood.\nPlace typography in a balanced poster composition, preferably top-left.\nSmaller secondary typography may include:\n“Northern Thai Chef”\nor\n“Chiang Mai Culinary Spirit”\n\nRendering:\nPixar-style 3D rendering with designer-toy influence:\n- matte textures\n- soft sculpted surfaces\n- simplified geometry\n- cinematic clarity\n- premium collectible-toy aesthetic\n- highly polished visual finish\n\nKeep the character stylized but recognizable as a Northern Thai culinary artisan.\nUse subtle texture or film grain only if it enhances warmth and atmosphere.\n\nDo not overload the composition with excessive props.\n\nComposition:\nPoster-like composition with strong negative space.\nThe chef occupies one strong visual anchor area.\nThe symbolic shadow occupies a larger visual field as the emotional and conceptual counterweight.\n\nThe image should instantly communicate:\nthis is not simply a chef portrait —\nit is a symbolic projection of Northern Thai culinary spirit and cultural identity.\n\nMood:\nIconic,\nwarm,\nculturally intelligent,\nsymbolic,\neditorial,\nemotionally memorable,\npremium gallery-poster aesthetic,\nbalancing traditional craftsmanship with modern conceptual design.\n\nAspect ratio:\n9:16 vertical.",
