        "prompt":  "Prompt Template:\n\n\u003cinstruction\u003e\n\n 1. Inference Engine\n\n   Input A is a [DEFINING_SCIENTIFIC_EXPERIMENT_OR_DISCOVERY] (e.g., Newton’s Prism Experiment, Galileo’s Falling Objects Demonstration, The Chemistry Volcano Reaction).\n\n   Deconstruct the experiment into   3 Spatial Zones  :\n\n   The Foreground (The Classroom):  Identify the [TEACHER_ACTION_ZONE] where the key explanation happens.\n\n   (e.g., [EXPERIMENT_SETUP_DESCRIPTION]).\n\n   The Mid-Ground (The Props):  Identify the specific [SCIENTIFIC_EQUIPMENT] used in the experiment.\n\n   (e.g., [LIST_OF_EQUIPMENT_AND_TOOLS]).\n\n   The Background (The Experiment):  Identify the [DRAMATIC_VISUAL_EFFECT] happening in the distance.\n\n   (e.g., [EXPERIMENT_OUTCOME_VISUAL]).\n\n 2. Container\n\n   Goal: \"Frozen Science Moment\" Diorama Photography.\n\n   The Object:  A thick, rectangular [CLASSROOM_TYPE] Diorama cutaway sitting on a black display base.\n\n   The Slice:  The front wall and roof are partially removed to reveal the interior (Dollhouse view).\n\n   The Texture:  Painted classroom walls, [FLOOR_TYPE], [FURNITURE_MATERIAL] with visible wear and educational posters.\n\n 3. Diorama\n\n   The Figures:    1:12 Scale Stylized Figures   (Caricature/Claymation style). Large heads, expressive faces.\n\n   The Lead:  A central figure ([LEAD_CHARACTER_ROLE]) looking [EMOTION_OR_EXPRESSION] while [SPECIFIC_ACTION].\n\n   The Support:  [SUPPORTING_CHARACTERS] observing closely, taking notes, or helping with equipment.\n\n   The Clutter:  High-density detail inside the room. [THEME_ACCURATE_POSTERS] on walls, [SCATTERED_LAB_ITEMS], notebooks, pencils, rulers, and lab tools scattered across the desks.\n\n   The Quote:  [FAMOUS_SCIENTIFIC_QUOTE_OR_PHRASE] is painted or projected onto the back wall of the classroom.\n\n 4. The Exterior (The Context):\n\n   The Surroundings:  The classroom sits on a patch of \"[SCHOOL_TERRAIN_TYPE]\" ([TERRAIN_EXAMPLES]).\n\n   The Distance:  In the far background, the \"[EXPERIMENT_NAME]\" visual effect is visible (e.g., [ENVIRONMENTAL_VISUAL_EFFECT]).\n\n   Lighting:  A bright [EXPERIMENT_GLOW_OR_SPOTLIGHT_COLOR] from the background effect casts long shadows through the classroom windows/doors, illuminating the figures from behind.\n\n   The Ghosts:  Faint, translucent \"Ghost Figures\" stand in the periphery outside the classroom, representing [REPRESENTATIVE_GHOST_FIGURES].\n\n 5. Typography (The Plaque):\n\n   Placement:  A Gold or Brass plate affixed to the black base.\n\n   Content:  \"[EXPERIMENT_NAME] - [DATE] - [TIME] - [LOCATION]. [TAGLINE].\"\n\nOutput:   ONE image, 1:1 Aspect Ratio, 3D Render, \"Claymation Educational\" aesthetic, Cinematic Lighting.\n\n\u003c/instruction\u003e",
