        "prompt":  "Template Name: Horizontal Brand Kit System\n\nPrompt Template:\n\n[USER INPUT — REQUIRED AT TOP]\n\nBRAND_NAME: [BRAND_NAME]\n\nCORE_MOOD: [CORE_MOOD]\n\nINSPIRATION_A: [INSPIRATION_A]\n\nINSPIRATION_B: [INSPIRATION_B]\n\nVISUAL_STYLE: [VISUAL_STYLE]\n\nCOLOR_DIRECTION: [COLOR_DIRECTION]\n\nFORM_LANGUAGE: [FORM_LANGUAGE]\n\nTYPOGRAPHY_STYLE: [TYPOGRAPHY_STYLE]\n\nMOTION_BEHAVIOR: [MOTION_BEHAVIOR]\n\nIMAGERY_STYLE: [IMAGERY_STYLE]\n\nMOOD_STACK: [MOOD_STACK]\n\nWORLD_A: [WORLD_A]\n\nWORLD_B: [WORLD_B]\n\nWORLD_C: [WORLD_C]\n\nNUMBER_OF_PAGES: [NUMBER_OF_PAGES]\n\nASPECT_RATIO: 16:9 (MANDATORY DEFAULT)\n\n[MASTER PROMPT — BRAND KIT SYSTEM V.4 (16:9 LOCKED)]\n\nTASK\n\nCreate a high-end, multi-page brand kit system for [BRAND_NAME] with a STRICT color-driven identity.\n\nALL OUTPUTS MUST USE 16:9 ASPECT RATIO.\n\nNO square. NO vertical. NO variation.\n\nASPECT RATIO SYSTEM (CRITICAL)\n\nEvery page = 16:9 landscape\n\nComposition must be designed for horizontal flow\n\nLeft-to-right visual hierarchy is REQUIRED\n\nLAYOUT BEHAVIOR:\n\nLeft = primary focus (hero / product / key visual)\n\nRight = supporting system (text / UI / breakdown)\n\nOR center-weighted with wide breathing space\n\nSPACING:\n\nWide margins\n\nHorizontal grid dominance\n\nNo cramped layouts\n\nCORE COLOR LOGIC (CRITICAL)\n\nPRIMARY BASE\n\n[PRIMARY_BASE_COLOR]\n\n70–80% usage\n\nSECONDARY\n\ngrayscale system (charcoal → white)\n\nACCENT (STRICT)\n\n[ACCENT_COLOR_OPTIONS] (choose per page)\n\n5–10% usage only\n\nRULE:\n\nAccent = signal only\n\nNEVER decorative fill\n\nNEVER multiple accents competing\n\nGRADIENT RULE\n\nOnly subtle directional gradient (neutral → accent)\n\nNo soft AI gradient\n\nVISUAL SYSTEM RULES (STRICT)\n\nLAYOUT\n\nHorizontal grid system\n\nClean segmentation\n\nUI-like modular structure\n\nHIERARCHY\n\nStrong horizontal reading flow\n\nBig headline left or center-left\n\nSupporting info right\n\nCOMPOSITION\n\nHeavy negative space\n\nAccent = tension point\n\nControlled asymmetry\n\nFORM LANGUAGE\n\nSharp geometry\n\nThin line UI elements\n\nTracking marks / grid hints inspired by [FORM_INSPIRATION] structure\n\nTYPOGRAPHY\n\nWhite = primary\n\nAccent = emphasis only\n\nTight tracking\n\nClean spacing\n\nIMAGERY\n\nDark, high contrast\n\nCraft spotlight ([PRODUCT_DETAILS], [MATERIAL_TEXTURES], [PROCESS_ELEMENTS])\n\nAbstract [PATTERN_TYPE] motion elements (controlled, minimal)\n\nNEGATIVE RULES (HARD BAN)\n\nNO square composition\n\nNO vertical layout\n\nNO colorful palette\n\nNO glow overload\n\nNO messy UI\n\nNO stock look\n\nNO random accent placement\n\nOUTPUT STRUCTURE\n\nGenerate [NUMBER_OF_PAGES] pages (ALL 16:9):\n\n01 — Brand World (hero left: [HERO_IMAGE_DESCRIPTION], system right)\n\n02 — Logo System (horizontal grid breakdown inspired by [LOGO_INSPIRATION])\n\n03 — Color/Typography (clean strip layout with [THEME]-based tones)\n\n04 — Imagery Direction (cinematic horizontal frames of [PROCESS_DESCRIPTION])\n\n05 — Product/Packaging (wide [PRODUCT_TYPE] showcase and material detail)\n\n06 — Applications (UI + exhibition + retail in horizontal layout)\n\nFINAL QUALITY CONTROL\n\nMUST feel designed for screen, not poster\n\nMUST use horizontal thinking\n\nMUST be consistent across all pages\n\nMUST feel like real agency system\n\nPush:\n\ncinematic composition\n\n[CRAFT_TYPE] precision + cultural restraint\n\nstrong left-to-right storytelling",
