        "prompt":  "Cultural Craft Diorama Macro Illustration\nTemplate Name: Cultural Craft Diorama Macro Illustration\n\nPrompt Template:\n\nBASE_MATERIAL: [GIANT_OBJECT_FRAME] (Giant [OBJECT_DESCRIPTION] fully opened/assembled, showing [STRUCTURAL_DETAIL])\n\nSEASON_THEME: [TIME_AND_WEATHER_SETTING]\n\nRURAL_SCENE_TYPE: [CULTURAL_ACTIVITY_OR_COMMUNITY_SETTING]\n\nHOUSE_STYLE: [REGIONAL_ARCHITECTURE_STYLE] and [SPECIFIC_WORK_AREA]ตั้งอยู่บริเวณ [PLACEMENT_ON_BASE_MATERIAL]\n\nFARM_ELEMENTS: [CRAFT_MATERIALS_1], [CRAFT_MATERIALS_2], [TOOLS_AND_EQUIPMENT], [RAW_MATERIALS]\n\nWEATHER_DETAILS: [LIGHTING_EFFECTS_THROUGH_MATERIAL], [ATMOSPHERIC_PARTICLES]\n\nCOLOR_MOOD: [PRIMARY_PALETTE_DESCRIPTION] ตัดกับ [SECONDARY_TONE_DESCRIPTION]\n\n⸻\n\nCreate a highly detailed surreal [THEME_NATION] craft-themed diorama integrated into a giant BASE_MATERIAL, with accurate cinematic composition and strong miniature realism. Strict Rule: No visible text, no titles, and no characters rendered on the image.\n\n⸻\n\nCORE CONCEPT\n\nThe entire miniature world must be built directly on or within the giant BASE_MATERIAL.\n\nThe BASE_MATERIAL acts as the primary landscape and cultural centerpiece.\n\nThe focus is entirely on the visual storytelling of [CULTURE_TYPE] handicraft culture through miniature art.\n\n⸻\n\nMAIN COMPOSITION\n\nCentered or slightly off-center dynamic composition where the BASE_MATERIAL dominates the focus.\n\nThe scale of the BASE_MATERIAL must feel enormous, with hyper-detailed textures showing [MATERIAL_TEXTURES], joints, and handcrafted structure.\n\nThe miniature village and craft elements are scaled down significantly to create a sense of wonder.\n\n⸻\n\nMINIATURE WORLD \u0026 CRAFT ELEMENTS\n\nBuild a complete RURAL_SCENE_TYPE directly on the BASE_MATERIAL.\n\nPlace a HOUSE_STYLE as the focal point of the miniature craft village.\n\nSurround the scene with hyper-realistic, tiny FARM_ELEMENTS ([CRAFT_AND_TOOL_SPECIFICS]).\n\nInclude tiny human figures in traditional [REGIONAL_OR_ETHNIC] attire [ACTION_VERB_1] and [ACTION_VERB_2].\n\nAll miniature elements must follow the [STRUCTURAL_ALIGNMENT] and physical contours of the BASE_MATERIAL.\n\n⸻\n\nATMOSPHERE \u0026 LIGHTING\n\nThe background environment should complement the BASE_MATERIAL (e.g., [BACKGROUND_SETTING_DESCRIPTION]).\n\nSEASON_THEME and WEATHER_DETAILS must be visually represented through [LIGHTING_QUALITY], [SHADOW_BEHAVIOR], and floating particles.\n\nUse COLOR_MOOD as the master palette for a cinematic, high-end handcrafted aesthetic.\n\n⸻\n\nTECHNICAL RULES\n\nPhotorealistic miniature realism with high-fidelity material textures.\n\nSlightly elevated eye-level perspective with a strong bokeh effect on the background.\n\nSoft, natural lighting that emphasizes the 3D depth of the diorama.\n\nABSOLUTE RESTRICTION: Do not include any text, letters, or numbers anywhere in the image.\n\nNo floating objects; everything must be physically grounded.",
