        "prompt":  "Childlike Crayon Drawing Sequence\nTemplate Name: Childlike Crayon Drawing Sequence\n\nPrompt Template:\n\n{\n\n\"PROMPT\": \"A child\u0027s crayon drawing on [CANVAS_TYPE].\",\n\n\"MANDATORY [LANGUAGE_MODE] TITLE (CRITICAL)\": \"- The [TITLE_TEXT_VARIABLE] \"[TITLE_TEXT]\" must be prominently written in the [POSITION_ON_PAGE] of the page.\\n- The text must be in [LANGUAGE_MODE], written with a messy, innocent child\u0027s handwriting using various colored wax crayons.\\n- The letters should be slightly uneven in size, mimicking a young child learning to write.\\n- Ensure 100% correct [LANGUAGE_MODE] spelling with no broken characters.\",\n\n\"CORE CONCEPT \u0026 SUBJECT\": \"- [MAIN_SUBJECT] drawn with chunky wax-crayon strokes, wobbly uneven outlines, and simple flat shapes.\\n- Show the process in a playful, childlike sequence:\\n • [PROCESS_STEP_1]\\n • [PROCESS_STEP_2]\\n • [PROCESS_STEP_3]\\n • [PROCESS_STEP_4]\\n- Important elements are drawn disproportionately big, filling the center of the page.\\n- Include simple, friendly human figures ([CHARACTER_TYPES]) with round faces, dot eyes, and big smiles.\",\n\n\"COLORING \u0026 TEXTURE\": \"- [COLOR_TONE] with messy coloring that playfully overflows the outlines.\\n- Bright [PRIMARY_OBJECTS] with mixed colors.\\n- Visible heavy pressure marks, wax smudges, and uneven scribble shading.\",\n\n\"BACKGROUND \u0026 COMPOSITION\": \"- [BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS] such as [ELEMENT_1], [ELEMENT_2], [ELEMENT_3], and [ELEMENT_4].\\n- A few tiny margin doodles and crayon marks scattered naturally on the paper.\\n- Flat composition with absolutely no realistic perspective or shading.\",\n\n\"FINAL FEEL\": \"- [MOOD_FEEL] art style.\\n- Authentic, innocent, and looks exactly like a [GRADE_LEVEL_TYPE] student drawing about “[TOPIC_NAME]”.\",\n\n\"NEGATIVE PROMPT\": \"missing text, English text, professional fonts, straight lines, perfect handwriting, realistic, 3D render, digital painting, smooth shading, proper anatomy, adult art, clean edges, highly detailed\"\n\n}",
