        "prompt":  "Artisan Heritage Craftsmanship Diorama Template\nTemplate Name: Artisan Heritage Craftsmanship Diorama Template\n\nPrompt Template:\n\n2x2 grid, do this for 4 master [CULTURAL_IDENTITY] [ARTISAN_TYPE] ([SPECIFIC_CRAFT_MAKERS]);\n\nAnchor: A 3D diorama of a highly skilled [REGION/ETHNICITY] [GENDER] artisan ([CULTURAL_IDENTITY], traditional attire with [SPECIFIC_CLOTHING_DETAILS]) seated at a wooden work desk, intensely sketching and annotating a [CRAFT_OBJECT] design; the paper shows a precise cutaway and structural layout ([KEY_STRUCTURAL_COMPONENTS]) consistent with real traditional [CRAFT_TYPE] construction; four floating grayscale “schematic panels” display iconic views ([COMPONENTS_OR_VIEWS_LIST]) with clean technical labels; behind him stands a deluxe “[CRAFT_NAME] – Heritage Craft Edition” display box with artisan credit, featuring a miniature [CRAFT_OBJECT] model in dynamic assembly poses; floating props: [LIST_OF_TOOLS_AND_MATERIALS]; clean studio sweep background::3.8\n\nMorphology: premium stylized figure, crisp hard-surface edges blended with handcrafted softness, technical linework fused with [SPECIFIC_CULTURAL_MOTIFS] ([LOCAL_PATTERN_NAMES]), hatch patterns, measurement ticks, [GEOMETRIC_GUIDES] consistent with [CRAFT_TYPE] drafting language::3.2\n\nMaterial Physics: slightly glossy stylized figure texture, [TEXTURE_DETAIL_1] with visible grain, semi-matte display box with spot UV + [METAL_FINISH] title, [TEXTURE_DETAIL_2] insert, subtle [MATERIAL_SHEEN], crisp material separation::3.2\n\nIllumination: high-end studio lighting, soft key + fill, subtle rim light enhancing texture of [PRIMARY_MATERIALS], controlled reflections, readable labels and diagram clarity::1.6\n\nRender Stack: collectible product photography, shallow DOF but readable linework, isometric three-quarter angle, clean cyclorama background, sharp focus on face + hand + schematic page::1.2\n\nNegative: photoreal skin, messy stains, illegible labels, gibberish text, watermark, logos, extra limbs, deformed fingers, blurry diagrams, dull colors, harsh contrast:: -1.2",
