        "category":  "วัฒนธรรม",
        "prompt":  "Thai Vintage Frame Illustration Template\nTemplate Name: Thai Vintage Frame Illustration Template\n\nPrompt Template:\n\nTASK: Create a symmetrical, elegant vintage Thai illustration featuring an architectural frame and a botanical garden background, based on the selected [USER INPUT].\n\nCORE LOGIC — LANGUAGE SYSTEM\n\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE = [CHOSEN_MODE]:\n\n→ Use [MAIN_TITLE_VAR_1] + [SUB_TITLE_VAR_1] only\n\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE = [CHOSEN_MODE]:\n\n→ Use [MAIN_TITLE_VAR_2] + [SUB_TITLE_VAR_2] only\n\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE = BILINGUAL:\n\n→ Main = [PRIMARY_LANGUAGE]\n\n→ Sub = [SECONDARY_LANGUAGE] (smaller, secondary hierarchy)\n\nTypography must be:\n\n100% correct spelling\n\nNo garbled [LANGUAGE] characters\n\nClean readable hierarchy\n\nCOMPOSITION \u0026 LAYOUT (THE SYMMETRY RULE)\n\nArchitectural Frame:\n\nA central, ornate [ARCH_STYLE] with two pillars and a decorative arch top\n\nForeground Center:\n\nPlace [CENTER_OBJECT] at bottom-center (hero object)\n\nTypography Layering:\n\nMAIN_TITLE: [MAIN_TITLE_TEXT], centered, elegant serif style\n\nPositioned behind object but inside arch\n\nSUB_TITLE: [SUB_TITLE_TEXT], smaller, neatly placed below or above\n\nBalcony Layer:\n\nDecorative railing separating foreground and [BACKGROUND_TYPE]\n\nARTISTIC STYLE (THAI VINTAGE ILLUSTRATION)\n\nStyle: Flat vector + subtle watercolor/paper grain texture\n\nLinework: Fine, clean, elegant\n\nSymmetry: Perfect left-right balance\n\nDepth Layers:\n\nFrame (front)\n\nObject + Text (mid)\n\n[BACKGROUND_VIEW] (back)\n\nCOLOR \u0026 MOOD\n\nStrictly follow [COLOR_PALETTE]\n\nTone: [MOOD_DESCRIPTION], calm, elegant\n\nNo color deviation\n\nRESTRICTIONS\n\nNo photorealism\n\nNo modern UI / banner / CTA\n\nNo random text\n\nNo watermark / logo\n\nNo perspective distortion\n\nClean composition only\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n\nAspect Ratio: [RATIO]\n\nHigh-resolution illustration\n\nPrint-ready quality\n\nCenter-balanced composition",
