        "timestampRaw":  "15/5/2026, 15:47:01",
        "category":  "วัฒนธรรม",
        "prompt":  "Logo Concept Breakdown System\nTemplate Name: Logo Concept Breakdown System\n\nPrompt Template:\n\nMAIN_CONCEPT: [MAIN_CONCEPT]\n\nCOLOR_PALETTE: [COLOR_PALETTE]\n\nEQUATION_ELEMENTS:\n\n[ELEMENT_1]\n\n[ELEMENT_2]\n\n[ELEMENT_3]\n\n[ELEMENT_4]\n\n[MASTER PROMPT — FLAT VECTOR LOGO CONCEPT BREAKDOWN]\n\nTASK: Create a professional \"Logo Concept Breakdown\" (Visual Equation) presentation board showcasing the design thinking behind a logo.\n\n[CORE SETTINGS]\n\nMAIN_CONCEPT: {MAIN_CONCEPT}\n\nCOLOR_PALETTE: {COLOR_PALETTE}\n\nSTYLE: Pure 2D flat vector graphic, corporate tech identity (CI) presentation, absolute minimalism. Pure seamless white background.\n\n[COMPOSITION \u0026 LAYOUT SYSTEM]\n\nThe canvas must be divided into two distinct vertical tiers:\n\nTIER 1: THE FINAL LOGO (Top 60% of canvas)\n\nCenter the final assembled logo in a large, prominent scale.\n\nThe logo MUST be a clean, 2D flat minimalist vector design that logically combines the visual traits of the elements from Tier 2.\n\nThe final form should clearly read as an [ABSTRACT_SUBJECT] using [GEOMETRIC_METHOD], modular segmentation, and refined spacing.\n\nTIER 2: THE VISUAL EQUATION (Bottom 40% of canvas)\n\nCreate a horizontal row demonstrating the \"Visual Equation\" or \"Formula\".\n\nEquation Structure: [Vector Icon 1] + [Vector Icon 2] + [Vector Icon 3] + [Vector Icon 4].\n\nUse literal, clean 2D \"+\" signs between the icons.\n\nGenerate highly simplified, flat vector icons representing: {EQUATION_ELEMENTS}.\n\nThe icons must visually look like the exact \"puzzle pieces\" or \"strokes\" used to construct the final logo in Tier 1.\n\n[TYPOGRAPHY \u0026 ANNOTATION]\n\nBelow each vector icon in Tier 2, place its corresponding label from the {EQUATION_ELEMENTS}.\n\nUse a clean, modern, small Sans-Serif font (like Helvetica, SF Pro, or Product Sans).\n\nText must be perfectly center-aligned under its respective icon.\n\n[STRICT CONSTRAINTS (DO NOT VIOLATE)]\n\nNO 3D effects, NO photorealism, NO embossing, NO drop shadows, NO gradients.\n\nMust strictly use ONLY the colors defined in {COLOR_PALETTE} as solid flat fills.\n\nThe visual relationship between the bottom row icons and the top final logo must be obvious, precise, and structurally logical.\n\nThe layout must feel spacious, premium, tech-oriented, and extremely organized.",
