        "prompt":  "Prompt Template:\n\n2x2 grid, do this for 4 [TRADITIONAL_CULTURE] professions:\n\nSubjects:\n\n[SUBJECT_1]\n\n[SUBJECT_2]\n\n[SUBJECT_3]\n\n[SUBJECT_4]\n\nRender_Target =\n\n( 3D_Vinyl_Toy_[CULTURE_THEME]Artisan_At_Desk  1.5 ) + ( Inferred_Subculture_Fashion[CULTURE_THEME]  1.2 ) +\n\n( Four_Floating_2D_Flash_Cards_Top_Row * 1.8 ) +\n\n( Inferred_Motifs_Of_[CULTURE_THEME]_On_Cards * 1.5 ) +\n\n( Floating_Flat_Black_2D_Tool_Icons * 1.2 ) +\n\n( 3D_Product_Packaging_Box_Background * 1.0 ) +\n\n( Clean_White_Studio_Void * 1.5 ) -\n\n( Realistic_Human_Skin / 2.0 ) -\n\n( 3D_Rendered_Top_Cards / 2.0 )\n\nDetails per panel:\n\nCharacter:\n\nStylized 3D vinyl toy figure (non-realistic skin, smooth plastic finish)\n\nEach artisan seated at a small work desk\n\nSlightly exaggerated proportions (designer toy aesthetic)\n\nFashion (Inferred_Subculture_Fashion_[CULTURE_THEME]):\n\nModernized [CULTURE_THEME] clothing: [TEXTILE_TYPE], [SPECIFIC_GARMENTS], [CULTURAL_ACCESSORIES]\n\nFusion of traditional [REGION_NAME] textiles with contemporary craft culture\n\nFlash Cards (Top Row):\n\n4 floating 2D cards above each character\n\nEach card contains [CULTURE_THEME] motifs:\n\n• [MOTIF_1]\n\n• [MOTIF_2]\n\n• [MOTIF_3]\n\n• [MOTIF_4]\n\nTool Icons (Floating, flat black):\n\nMinimal 2D icons representing tools of each profession:\n\n• [TOOLS_SET_1]\n\n• [TOOLS_SET_2]\n\n• [TOOLS_SET_3]\n\n• [TOOLS_SET_4]\n\nDesk Elements:\n\nMiniature craft materials relevant to each profession\n\nClean arrangement, slight storytelling clutter\n\nBackground:\n\n3D product packaging box behind each figure\n\nSubtle [CULTURE_THEME] graphic accents printed on box\n\nClean white studio void environment\n\nLighting:\n\nSoft studio lighting, subtle shadows\n\nHigh clarity, collectible toy photography aesthetic\n\nOutput:\n\nOne image, 1:1 aspect ratio\n\n2x2 grid layout\n\nUltra-clean, high-detail, designer toy + cultural fusion style",
