        "prompt":  "Create an ultra-detailed hyper-realistic cinematic miniature world map of [COUNTRY_NAME], designed as a premium luxury travel-poster masterpiece.\n\nCOUNTRY_NAME: Thailand\nLANGUAGE_MODE: BILINGUAL\nCAPITAL_CITY: Bangkok\nICONIC_LANDMARKS: Grand Palace, Wat Arun, Wat Phra Kaew, Maya Bay, Doi Suthep Temple, Ayutthaya Historical Park, Giant Swing, Railay Beach, Sukhothai Historical Park, Chiang Mai Old City\nNATURAL_FEATURES: tropical islands, turquoise Andaman Sea, limestone cliffs, lush rice terraces, dense northern mountains, waterfalls, floating markets, jungle forests, Mekong River, coconut beaches\nCULTURAL_IDENTITY: Thai street food culture, tuk-tuks, long-tail boats, Muay Thai, Songkran Festival, floating lanterns, elephant culture, golden temples, night markets, silk weaving, tropical fruit markets, Lanna architecture\n\nLanguage mode:\nUse LANGUAGE_MODE for all visible text in the image.\n\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE is ENGLISH, use English for the country title, tagline, labels, and infographic details.\n\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE is LOCAL_LANGUAGE, use the country’s local language or writing system for all visible text.\n\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE is BILINGUAL, show the main country title in both English and the local language, with labels and infographic details using a balanced bilingual layout.\n\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE is NO_TEXT, do not include any readable text, labels, typography, captions, or infographic words. Communicate everything visually through icons, symbols, landmarks, composition, and non-readable graphic marks.\n\nCore concept:\nRender the entire country as a massive handcrafted floating island civilization suspended in soft atmospheric clouds. The country should feel like a complete miniature world, combining geography, cities, culture, infrastructure, nature, landmarks, and storytelling into one cohesive visual composition.\n\nWorld structure:\nShow highly detailed terrain elevation across the country. Include visually rich mountains, forests, rivers, coastlines, waterfalls, deserts, lakes, farmland, villages, urban zones, and region-specific natural environments based on the country’s real geography.\n\nBlend natural beauty with modern development, historical heritage, and national identity. The island should feel geographically believable, densely layered, immersive, and highly zoomable.\n\nRegional identity:\nEvery major region should feel visually unique and culturally alive. Represent different cities, provinces, or regions through distinct architecture, atmosphere, colors, traditions, and landscape identity.\n\nIntegrate ICONIC_LANDMARKS naturally into the environment. Historical or cultural regions should feature appropriate monuments, temples, castles, mosques, churches, shrines, traditional districts, markets, or iconic structures where relevant.\n\nNatural regions should reflect the country’s authentic environmental identity through NATURAL_FEATURES.\n\nCapital city:\nFeature CAPITAL_CITY as a vibrant cinematic metropolis. Show realistic skyline details, glowing streets, dense urban storytelling, transportation systems, public spaces, and visually rich infrastructure.\n\nThe capital should feel energetic, modern, important, and visually connected to the overall country composition.\n\nInfrastructure and movement:\nInclude highways, railways, bridges, ports, airports, tiny moving vehicles, airplanes, trains, ferries, ships, and boats where appropriate.\n\nThe miniature world should feel active and alive with small-scale movement, realistic transport systems, and subtle environmental storytelling details throughout the country.\n\nCultural details:\nIntegrate CULTURAL_IDENTITY subtly throughout the landscape. Add details related to food culture, transportation, festivals, regional symbols, wildlife, traditional clothing, markets, street life, music, sports, technology, national identity, and everyday life when relevant.\n\nThese details should feel naturally embedded into the miniature world, not added as disconnected icons.\n\nTypography and information design:\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE is not NO_TEXT, use a clean, minimal, luxury editorial typography layout.\n\nPlace bold oversized “[COUNTRY_NAME]” typography prominently within the composition. The font style should feel inspired by the country’s identity and culture.\n\nAdd a cinematic tagline near the main title. Add elegant minimal labels for major cities and landmarks, integrated naturally into the environment.\n\nInclude refined information details showing population, language, currency, tourism, famous exports, cultural influence, technology, cuisine, and transportation systems where appropriate.\n\nKeep all typography clean, premium, readable, and visually integrated.\n\nIf LANGUAGE_MODE is NO_TEXT, replace labels and information text with clean icons, visual symbols, and non-readable graphic marks.\n\nVisual style:\nHyper-detailed miniature world aesthetic, cinematic travel-documentary mood, premium luxury travel poster design, high-detail environmental realism, satellite-inspired terrain readability, bright elegant presentation, emotionally immersive composition, and highly zoomable micro-details everywhere.\n\nLighting and color:\nUse vibrant natural colors inspired by COUNTRY_NAME. Apply premium cinematic color grading, realistic lighting behavior, atmospheric fog depth, cinematic cloud formations, and reflective environmental surfaces.\n\nMaintain strong depth layering, beautiful contrast, and visual richness without becoming chaotic.\n\nComposition:\nUse the most suitable composition for the subject and destination identity. The country island should be the dominant centerpiece.\n\nCreate a strong visual hierarchy with a clear title area when LANGUAGE_MODE is not NO_TEXT, and a clean information detail area when LANGUAGE_MODE is not NO_TEXT.\n\nKeep rich micro-detail throughout the central landscape. The overall design should feel expensive, modern, timeless, polished, and instantly eye-catching.\n\nDo not force any specific aspect ratio.\n\nStrict constraints:\nNO fixed aspect ratio\nNO messy or cluttered information layout\nNO generic flat map appearance\nNO empty or under-detailed regions\nNO random fantasy elements unrelated to the country\nNO weak typography hierarchy\nNO dull or lifeless atmosphere\nNO unreadable text when text is required\nNO readable text when LANGUAGE_MODE is NO_TEXT\n\nKeep the image cinematic, culturally rich, emotionally powerful, and highly polished\n\nFinal result:\nAn 8K masterpiece travel-poster illustration of COUNTRY_NAME as a floating miniature world civilization, combining geography, culture, architecture, infrastructure, natural identity, famous landmarks, and national storytelling into one luxurious, hyper-detailed, cinematic visual experience.",
