        "prompt":  "[USER_INPUT]\nPLACE: สะพานนวรัฐ จังหวัดเชียงใหม่\nLANGUAGE_MODE: Thai\nCreate a highly detailed architectural blueprint poster based on [PLACE].\n[SMART ANALYSIS]\nAnalyze [PLACE] automatically and determine:\nwhat type of place it is\nits most recognizable architectural identity\nkey structural features\nhistorical or cultural importance\nsuitable blueprint layout\nappropriate diagrams, annotations, measurements, and technical details\nbest visual hierarchy for presenting the place clearly\n[CORE CONCEPT]\nDesign a premium architectural blueprint poster that presents [PLACE] as both an iconic destination and an engineered structure.\nThe image should combine:\n\na large realistic central view of [PLACE]\nwhite technical drafting lines\narchitectural elevation drawings\nfloor plans or site plans when relevant\ncross-sections or cutaway diagrams when relevant\nfoundation or structural diagrams when relevant\nmeasurement annotations\nmaterial notes\nengineering-style labels\nclean infographic layout\n[VISUAL STYLE]\nUse a vintage engineering blueprint aesthetic with:\ndeep cyan-blue blueprint background\nwhite technical line art\nprecise drafting details\nsubtle blueprint paper texture\nclean grid-based composition\nrealistic landmark rendering mixed with schematic overlays\ncinematic sky with soft clouds if suitable\nmuseum-quality architectural presentation\n[LAYOUT]\nMake [PLACE] the main visual focus.\nPlace the realistic central structure prominently.\nSurround it with automatically selected technical diagrams based on the nature of [PLACE].\nFor example:\n\nif [PLACE] is a tower, emphasize elevation, height comparison, vertical structure, and load flow\nif [PLACE] is a temple or cultural building, emphasize form geometry, material, plan, and symbolic structure\nif [PLACE] is a palace or government building, emphasize façade symmetry, floor plan, and classical proportions\nif [PLACE] is a skyscraper, emphasize height, core structure, foundation, wind-load logic, and vertical sections\nif [PLACE] is a bridge, emphasize span structure, support piers, traffic load distribution, steel reinforcement logic, river-crossing geometry, structural rhythm, cross-section engineering, and foundation systems beneath the Ping River\n[LANGUAGE MODE]\nUse [LANGUAGE_MODE] for all visible text.\nIf [LANGUAGE_MODE] is THAI, use Thai only.\nIf [LANGUAGE_MODE] is ENGLISH, use English only.\nIf [LANGUAGE_MODE] is BILINGUAL, use Thai and English in a clean technical hierarchy.\nIf [LANGUAGE_MODE] is NO_TEXT, do not include readable text, labels, captions, or annotations.\n[TYPOGRAPHY]\nIf [LANGUAGE_MODE] is not NO_TEXT, include the name “[PLACE]” clearly.\nUse clean architectural drafting typography.\nAdd short technical labels, dimensions, structural notes, and diagram captions where useful.\nKeep all text organized, readable, and visually integrated.\n[TEXT ACCURACY RULE]\nAll visible text must match [LANGUAGE_MODE], be correctly spelled, and remain readable.\nFor Thai text, use correct Thai spelling, vowel placement, tone marks, and natural spacing.\nDo not generate fake letters, broken Thai, pseudo-English, distorted characters, or random extra text.\n[DETAILS]\nAutomatically generate relevant details for [PLACE], such as:\nreinforced concrete bridge structure\nsteel guardrail systems\nrhythmic bridge-span geometry\nPing River relationship\nChiang Mai urban context\ntraffic circulation logic\npedestrian pathway dimensions\nstructural load-transfer diagrams\nbridge elevation modules\nhistorical development notes\nengineering callouts\nriverbank infrastructure\nnighttime illumination systems\nhuman scale comparison\nsurrounding Chiang Mai skyline references\n[STRICT CONSTRAINTS]\nNO random landmarks.\nNO unrelated diagrams.\nNO messy layout.\nNO cartoon style.\nNO low-detail sketches.\nNO decorative clutter.\nNO weak recognition of [PLACE].\nNO fake text or misspelled labels.\nKeep the poster clean, technical, premium, and location-specific.\n[FINAL INTENT]\nCreate a museum-quality architectural blueprint poster of [PLACE], automatically analyzing its architecture, structure, materials, cultural identity, transportation importance, and engineering logic, then presenting everything as a refined vintage blueprint infographic with a realistic central landmark image, precise white drafting diagrams, and language-controlled typography.\nMake the aspect ratio 4:3",
