        "prompt":  "BRAND_NAME_TH: \"นักเล่าเรื่อง\"\nTAGLINE_TH: \"เล่าเรื่องให้เป็นเรื่องเล่า\"\nCONCEPT_SHAPE: A minimalist street sign or a narrow alleyway perspective.\nFONT_BEHAVIOR: The Thai letters \"นั-ก-เ-ล่-า-เ-รื่-อ-ง\" should use forced perspective, looking like they are receding into a distance along a street.\nCOLOR_PALETTE: Asphalt Grey, Neon Yellow, and White.\n\nTASK: Create a premium, minimalist Thai typographic logo poster based on the role of an educational supervisor who specializes in delivering knowledge and professional narratives to fellow teachers.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY DESIGN (THE CORE FOCUS)\n- Main Title: Render [นักเล่าเรื่อง] as the central focus.\n- Font Style: Use a \"Modern-Traditional Thai Serif\" font with high contrast (thick and thin strokes) and sharp, elegant terminals.\n- Form Interaction: The letters must not be static; they must behave according to [FONT_BEHAVIOR]. Integrate the vertical or horizontal strokes of the Thai characters to mimic the flow of knowledge transmission, structured explanation, and professional storytelling among teachers.\n- Accuracy: 100% correct Thai spelling with perfect placement of vowels and tone marks.\n\nSYMBOLIC COMPOSITION\n- Iconography: Include a minimalist, single-weight line art of [CONCEPT_SHAPE] at the base of the typography, symbolizing a pathway of knowledge dissemination and professional guidance.\n- Integration: The typography should appear to be \"originating\" from or \"growing\" out of the concept shape. \n- Sub-title: Place the [TAGLINE_TH] at the bottom in a clean, smaller, modern Thai Sans-serif font, accompanied by a subtle decorative line or dots.\n\nARTISTIC STYLE (MINIMALIST VECTOR)\n- Aesthetic: Flat 2D Vector Illustration. No gradients, no shadows, no 3D effects.\n- Linework: Clean, bold, and deliberate. Every line must serve a purpose in the composition.\n- Layout: Perfectly centered and symmetrical, with generous negative space to emphasize the typography.\n\nCOLOR \u0026 MOOD\n- Palette: Strictly use the [COLOR_PALETTE]. \n- Background: A solid, matte background that provides high contrast for the font and icon.\n- Mood: Sophisticated, premium, and culturally resonant, reflecting academic professionalism and instructional leadership.\n\nSTRICT RESTRICTIONS\n- NO photorealism, NO 3D rendering.\n- NO English text unless specified in the brand name.\n- NO messy or cluttered elements. \n- NO halftone dots or pixelated textures.",
