        "prompt":  "Here is the adapted prompt for Bo Sang Walking Street using your template structure:\n\n⸻\n\nPROMPT: Isometric Floating City Life — Bo Sang Walking Street\n\nA highly detailed isometric 3D illustration of Bo Sang Walking Street, presented as a floating composition on a clean white background. The scene is divided into multiple interconnected micro-scenes that together tell a cohesive story of everyday life, street culture, and nostalgic atmosphere in Chiang Mai.\n\nREGION_THEME: Traditional Lanna craft street market — Bo Sang umbrella village\nARCHITECTURAL_STYLE: Northern Thai wooden shop houses, open-front craft studios, bamboo structures, paper umbrella stalls, lantern-decorated street facades\nCORE_ACTIVITIES: Artisans hand-painting umbrellas, families strolling and shopping, street food vendors grilling local snacks, tourists browsing handicrafts, children playing with colorful paper umbrellas, live folk music performance\nKEY_VEHICLES: Bicycles, motorbikes, local pickup trucks (songthaew), small vendor carts\nCOLOR_PALETTE: Warm earthy tones with vibrant accents — saffron yellow, crimson red, indigo blue, natural wood brown, soft cream\n\nThe composition features layered storytelling moments across the street: umbrella-making workshops flowing into lively market stalls, food corners blending into performance spaces, and quiet human interactions embedded throughout. Each zone is distinct yet visually connected through pathways, perspective, and rhythm.\n\nUse soft global illumination, gentle shadows, and stylized but semi-realistic textures. Maintain a clean floating layout with no background clutter — all elements appear as a cohesive miniature world suspended in space.\n\nBalance architecture, people, and vehicles evenly to create a rich but readable scene. Emphasize warmth, nostalgia, and cultural identity through lighting, color, and human-centered storytelling.\n\nUltra-clean, high-resolution, editorial illustration style.",
