        "prompt":  "[USER INPUT]\nPOSTER_THEME: Lanna Bo Sang umbrella festival street culture and handcrafted artistry celebration\nGIANT_CREATURE: A giant, elegant Lanna celestial guardian (Yaksha-inspired) wearing traditional northern Thai textiles, holding and sheltering under a massive painted Bo Sang umbrella.\nMAIN_ENVIRONMENT: A vibrant Bo Sang village street filled with rows of colorful handmade paper umbrellas, bamboo frames, and artisan stalls under soft lantern light.\nFLUID_ELEMENT: A flowing, swirling stream of watercolor paint in red, indigo, and gold tones, symbolizing hand-painted umbrella patterns drifting across the scene.\nTINY_CHARACTERS_ACTIVITIES:\n- Artisans hand-painting intricate floral patterns on large umbrella canopies.\n- Children spinning small paper umbrellas while running through the street.\n- A group of villagers assembling bamboo umbrella frames together.\n- Performers dancing traditional Lanna fon leb (fingernail dance) beneath hanging umbrellas.\n- Tourists taking photos while holding brightly colored umbrellas in playful poses.\nCOLOR_PALETTE: Crimson Red, Indigo Blue, Bamboo Beige, Gold Yellow, Soft White.\nTEXT_ELEMENTS: Bold, dynamic Thai text \"ร่มบ่อสร้าง!\" with decorative Lanna-inspired comic burst lines.\nBORDER_STYLE: A border made of repeating Lanna geometric patterns and stylized umbrella motifs in red and gold.\n\n### [MASTER PROMPT — CHAOTIC SURREAL POP-ART POSTER V.1]\n\nTASK: Create a highly detailed, busy, and surreal illustration poster based on the [POSTER_THEME]. The style must be a flat, comic-book pop-art aesthetic with a chaotic, playful composition (similar to a \u0027Where\u0027s Waldo\u0027 illustration).\n\nCOMPOSITION \u0026 SCALING\n- Contain the entire scene within a defined, decorative [BORDER_STYLE].\n- Use extreme scale contrast: Feature the [GIANT_CREATURE] dominating the upper portion of the canvas.\n- Build the environment around the [MAIN_ENVIRONMENT] and the [FLUID_ELEMENT] flowing dynamically through the center.\n- Scatter the [TINY_CHARACTERS_ACTIVITIES] throughout the composition. The tiny characters must interact with the giant elements and fluids in surreal, whimsical ways.\n\nSTYLE \u0026 RENDERING (STRICT ADHERENCE)\n- Aesthetic: Flat vector pop-art / comic illustration style.\n- Linework: Consistent, clean, and distinct black outlines for all characters, objects, text, and environment details.\n- Coloring: Use the [COLOR_PALETTE] for bold, highly saturated, solid color fills. STRICTLY NO gradients, NO soft shading, NO 3D rendering, and NO photorealism.\n- Detail level: High density of distinct objects and characters packed together, but each rendered with simple, flat, clean vector graphics.\n\nTEXT \u0026 TYPOGRAPHY\n- Integrate [TEXT_ELEMENTS] organically into the upper section of the layout. The text should have matching black outlines and fit the playful pop-art vibe.\n\nRESTRICTIONS (ABSOLUTE)\n- Strictly NO 3D, NO realistic textures, and NO lighting/shadow effects.\n- Maintain a strict 2D flat illustrative appearance throughout.",
