        "prompt":  "– Define the core data structures\ntype LayerDepth = Float – 0.0 (back) to 1.0 (front)\ntype PaperTexture = (Grain, Thickness, Color)\ntype UI_Element = (Icon, Label, Position)\n\n– The core generation function\ngeneratePaperDiorama :: ChiangMaiDistrictData -\u003e GridConfig -\u003e RenderSettings -\u003e Image\ngeneratePaperDiorama district grid settings =\nlet\n– 1. Extract architectural and cultural features from the district data\nlandmarks = extractLandmarks district\nterrain = extractTerrain district\n\n    -- 2. Create the depth map for the paper cut effect\n    depthMap = createDepthMap [\n        Layer(0.0, background_sky),\n        Layer(0.2, distant_mountains),\n        Layer(0.4, mid_ground_cultural_landscape),\n        Layer(0.7, foreground_landmarks),\n        Layer(0.9, ui_overlay_frame)\n    ]\n    -- 3. Apply \"Paper Cut\" rendering pipeline\n    renderedScene = applyPaperPhysics (\n        lighting = WarmGoldenHour,\n        shadowIntensity = HighContrast,\n        material = TexturedCardstock\n    ) depthMap\n    -- 4. Compose the UI overlay (dynamic based on district data)\n    finalImage = composeUI renderedScene [\n        Title(district.name, position=TopLeft),\n        Legend(district.landmarks, position=LeftSide),\n        NavigationArrows(position=Bottom),\n        LevelIndicator(position=BottomRight)\n    ]\nin\nfinalImage\n\n– Execute: Generate 2x2 Grid\nrenderGrid([\ngeneratePaperDiorama(\nSaraphiData {\nlandmarks = [\n“Yang Na Road”,\n“Ancient Rain Trees”,\n“Lanna Temples”,\n“Longan Orchards”\n],\nterrain = [\n“Ping River Basin”,\n“Agricultural Landscape”,\n“Rural Villages”\n]\n},\nGrid(0,0),\nSettings\n),\n\ngeneratePaperDiorama(\n    SanKamphaengData {\n        landmarks = [\n            \"Bo Sang Umbrella Village\",\n            \"Saa Paper Workshops\",\n            \"Lanna Sky Lantern Craft\",\n            \"San Kamphaeng Hot Springs\"\n        ],\n        terrain = [\n            \"Craft Villages\",\n            \"Rice Fields\",\n            \"Foothill Landscape\"\n        ]\n    },\n    Grid(0,1),\n    Settings\n),\ngeneratePaperDiorama(\n    MaeRimData {\n        landmarks = [\n            \"Queen Sirikit Botanic Garden\",\n            \"Elephant Conservation Sites\",\n            \"Mountain Resorts\",\n            \"Adventure Parks\"\n        ],\n        terrain = [\n            \"Mountain Valleys\",\n            \"Forest Landscape\",\n            \"Waterfalls\"\n        ]\n    },\n    Grid(1,0),\n    Settings\n),\ngeneratePaperDiorama(\n    ChomThongData {\n        landmarks = [\n            \"Doi Inthanon\",\n            \"Royal Agricultural Projects\",\n            \"Twin Pagodas\",\n            \"Cloud Forest Trails\"\n        ],\n        terrain = [\n            \"Highest Peak of Thailand\",\n            \"Misty Mountains\",\n            \"Terraced Fields\"\n        ]\n    },\n    Grid(1,1),\n    Settings\n)\n\n])\n\n– Visual Style Directives\npaperCraftStyle = {\ntheme: “Chiang Mai Cultural Heritage Collection”,\naesthetic: “Ultra-detailed layered papercraft shadowbox diorama”,\ncolorPalette: [\n“Lanna Gold”,\n“Teak Wood Brown”,\n“Temple Crimson”,\n“Mountain Emerald”,\n“Rice Field Green”,\n“Sky Blue”\n],\narchitecture: [\n“Traditional Lanna Temples”,\n“Wooden Northern Thai Houses”,\n“Ancient City Gates”,\n“Craft Villages”\n],\nculturalElements: [\n“Bo Sang Umbrellas”,\n“Saa Paper Art”,\n“Yi Peng Lanterns”,\n“Longan Orchards”,\n“Traditional Textiles”,\n“Lanna Festivals”\n],\nrendering: [\n“Multi-layer laser-cut paper”,\n“Rich dimensional depth”,\n“Intricate paper engineering”,\n“Museum-quality craftsmanship”,\n“Warm golden-hour lighting”,\n“Premium tourism poster aesthetic”,\n“Ultra-sharp focus”,\n“Masterpiece quality”\n]\n}",
