        "prompt":  "USER_INPUT\n\nPROJECT_NAME: กลุ่มนิเทศ ติดตามและประเมินผลการจัดการศึกษา\n\nMAIN_TITLE_HEADLINE: ขับเคลื่อนคุณภาพการศึกษา ด้วยการนิเทศ ติดตาม และประเมินผลอย่างเป็นระบบ\n\nSUBTITLE_DESCRIPTION: ศูนย์กลางการกำกับ ติดตาม สนับสนุน และพัฒนาคุณภาพการจัดการศึกษาสู่ความเป็นเลิศ ผ่านข้อมูลเชิงประจักษ์ นวัตกรรม และการบริหารจัดการเชิงคุณภาพ\n\nCORE_SELLING_POINTS: Academic Supervision Excellence / Monitoring \u0026 Evaluation Framework / Data-Driven Educational Quality / School Improvement Partnership / Digital Knowledge \u0026 Innovation Hub\n\nMAIN_VISUAL_SCENE: Contemporary Educational Supervision Center / Interactive Educational Analytics Dashboard / Digital Knowledge Hub / School Quality Development Network / Flowing Data Visualization / Architectural Glass Layers and Gold-Line Infographics\n\nPRIMARY_COLOR_PALETTE: Ivory White, Academic Gold, Soft Gray, Educational Blue, Deep Navy\n\nBOTTOM_INFO_HOTLINE: EDUCATIONAL SUPERVISION • MONITORING • EVALUATION • QUALITY ASSURANCE • DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION FOR EDUCATION\n\n⸻\n\n⸻\n\nPROMPT LOGIC\n\nCAMERA AND COMPOSITION\n\n* Viewpoint: Eye-level, perfectly flat orthographic perspective facing a panoramic institutional exhibition banner.\n* Visual Execution: Single cohesive image key-art execution, absolute strict adherence to a non-collage, non-multi-grid layout structure. Crisp edge-to-edge structural integration mimicking a premium educational strategic masterplan presentation board.\n* Lighting: Sophisticated, soft high-key ambient illumination casting ultra-faint, gentle shadows to preserve an expansive feeling of professionalism, transparency, and educational excellence.\n\nCANVAS ART DIRECTION \u0026 GRAPHIC WRAPPING\n\n* Core Aesthetic: Modern educational governance design meets executive-level institutional communication. Employs a premium, low-saturation color palette based strictly on PRIMARY_COLOR_PALETTE.\n* Visual Packaging \u0026 Texture: The primary elements from MAIN_VISUAL_SCENE are seamlessly wrapped and interwoven into a high-end educational development layout. Incorporate semi-transparent glass interfaces, floating educational dashboards, AI-powered knowledge visualization, flowing data streams, soft architectural curves, subtle paper-fold layers, hair-thin academic gold lines, ultra-faint strategic planning grids, precise educational system diagrams, organic knowledge-network contours, and elegant information-flow textures. Every visual element should resemble a national-level educational quality development proposal rather than a conventional infographic or poster.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY LOGIC\n\n* Structural Hierarchy: The layout is divided into a vast, airy upper-to-mid section for artistic educational imagery and typography, grounded by a clean, slim horizontal information bar along the absolute bottom margin.\n* Main Headline \u0026 Subtitle: Positioned as the primary visual focal point in the spacious upper-center or upper-left negative space. Displays MAIN_TITLE_HEADLINE in an elegant modern Thai display font expressing authority, credibility, and innovation. Accompanied by subtle English academic typography accents and understated institutional branding aesthetics.\n* Project Concept Text: Positioned directly beneath the main title, displaying SUBTITLE_DESCRIPTION as a thin, refined secondary block that communicates the strategic vision of educational supervision, quality assurance, and continuous improvement.\n* Baseline Info Bar: Anchored at the absolute bottom margin with institutional symmetry. Displays PROJECT_NAME, selected highlights from CORE_SELLING_POINTS, and information from BOTTOM_INFO_HOTLINE. Style: Clean, ultra-condensed low-contrast sans-serif typography in academic gold, educational blue, and soft gray, ensuring an executive-level educational leadership presentation finish.\n\nVISUAL MOOD \u0026 MESSAGE\n\n* Convey trust, professionalism, educational leadership, systemic quality improvement, innovation, collaboration, and future-ready educational transformation.\n* Visual atmosphere should feel like a national educational reform strategy exhibition, ministry-level educational quality showcase, or flagship educational innovation center presentation.",
