        "prompt":  "USER_INPUT\n\nHOLIDAY_OR_SOLAR_TERM: เทศกาลข้าวมันไก่ไทย (Thai Hainanese Chicken Rice Celebration)\n\nMAIN_TITLE_TEXT: ข้าวมันไก่\n\nENGLISH_SUBTITLE: The Harmony of Simplicity and Perfection\n\nBLESSING_TEXT_BLOCK: ข้าวหอมละมุนเรียงเม็ดงาม ไก่นุ่มชุ่มฉ่ำรสชาติกลมกล่อม ศิลปะแห่งความเรียบง่ายที่ครองใจผู้คนทุกยุคสมัย\n\nCORE_HOLIDAY_ELEMENT: Colossal, hyper-realistic poached chicken slices with glossy golden skin resting atop monumental fragrant rice terraces, surrounded by flowing streams of aromatic chicken oil and ginger-infused essence\n\nSURREAL_SCENE_FORMATION: The massive rice grains accumulate and layer together, forming surreal rolling hills and elegant agricultural plateaus. Monumental chicken slices transform into sculptural cliffs and valleys while golden chicken oil rivers wind gracefully through the landscape.\n\nMACRO_SURFACE_DETAILS: Individual rice grains rendered with delicate translucency and soft highlights, glistening chicken skin textures, subtle droplets of aromatic oil, finely minced ginger surfaces, fresh cucumber textures, and gentle warm steam trails floating upward.\n\nSMALL_SCALE_NARRATIVE: A tiny silhouette of a person standing atop a monumental slice of poached chicken, overlooking the endless fragrant rice landscape and golden rivers of chicken essence.\n\nCOLOR_SYSTEM_SPEC: Base #F8F5EF (Jasmine Rice Ivory), Accent 1 #E6D5B8 (Golden Rice Beige), Accent 2 Pantone 7402 C (Chicken Skin Gold), Dark #2B2118 (Roasted Soy Brown), Gold #872 C, low-saturation premium palette with soft lighting and clean white space\n\nBACKGROUND_ATMOSPHERE: Soft-focus minimalist backdrop featuring light culinary steam drifting through an expansive ivory void, evoking warmth, comfort, and refined culinary heritage.\n\n⸻\n\n⸻\n\nPROMPT LOGIC\n\nCAMERA AND COMPOSITION\n\n* Viewpoint: Eye-level cinematic perspective capturing a vertical high-end brand poster layout.\n* Scale Hierarchy: Dramatic asymmetrical scale contrast utilizing a light top and heavy bottom, paired with a large left and small right structural alignment. Clear distinction between virtual background elements and sharp foreground textures.\n* Lighting \u0026 Depth: Cinematic soft illumination with an ink wash misty feel, employing a shallow depth of field to naturally blur the background while keeping the core subject in crisp focus. Completely avoid any cluttered elements, modern tech vibes, or oversaturation.\n\nSOURCE MATERIAL INTEGRATION (USER-UPLOADED IMAGE ADAPTATION)\n\n* Conditional Asset Extraction: Carefully analyze the user-provided reference photo if available. Extract the core subject silhouettes, traditional material outlines, or texture geometries directly from the uploaded image.\n* Image-Free Default: If no reference photo or image asset is uploaded by the user, dynamically generate the entire visual layout from scratch based strictly on the textual descriptions supplied in CORE_HOLIDAY_ELEMENT and SURREAL_SCENE_FORMATION.\n\nCANVAS ART DIRECTION \u0026 GRAPHIC WRAPPING\n\n* Core Aesthetic: Eastern minimalist aesthetics seamlessly interwoven with premium, surreal commercial photography.\n* Color Execution: Strictly and precisely implement the unified color scheme defined in COLOR_SYSTEM_SPEC, applying the exact Hex codes, Pantone markers, and tonal weights evenly across the background, main subject, and graphical overlays to maintain a low-saturation premium look.\n* Backdrop Render: Construct the background based on BACKGROUND_ATMOSPHERE, blending the light misty sky, rice paper textures, and faint distant culinary landscapes into a seamless negative space void.\n* Subject Packaging: Render the main subject composed of CORE_HOLIDAY_ELEMENT forming the surreal layout defined in SURREAL_SCENE_FORMATION. The structures must showcase hyper-realistic macro details matching MACRO_SURFACE_DETAILS, highlighted by soft reflections, delicate folds, and crisp surface micro-contrasts. Inject the SMALL_SCALE_NARRATIVE element directly into the scene to establish a powerful sense of vast architectural scale.\n\nAUTOMATED CONTEXTUAL TYPOGRAPHY LOGIC\n\n* Layout Alignment Constraint: All text blocks, blessings, and titles must be rendered strictly in standard horizontal left-to-right rows. Vertical top-to-bottom character stacking is strictly forbidden to preserve a modern, premium look.\n* Dynamic Font Adaptation Style: The AI must automatically analyze the artistic theme, geometry, and era of the scene to select a matching high-end font style.\n    * If the scene feels organic, cultural, or traditional: Render using fluid, elegant, high-end traditional custom script calligraphy typography with spacious tracking.\n    * If the scene feels modern, geometric, or abstract: Render using ultra-clean, lightweight loopless modern typography with sharp, avant-garde facet cuts.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY COLOR CONTROL\n\n* Text Contrast Rule: All text glyphs, characters, and fonts must be rendered using a color that provides sharp, high-contrast visibility against its immediate backdrop layout.\n* Ink Tone Application: The primary titles and descriptive text blocks must never use the designated background Base color. Instead, apply the darkest tone from the palette (e.g., Dark or deep charcoal variants from COLOR_SYSTEM_SPEC) to render all typography, ensuring crisp legibility that mimics premium printed high-end editorial layouts. Elegant brand accents can optionally utilize the Gold or metallic indicators for key highlights only.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY POSITIONING\n\n* Top Left Corner: Displays the oversized semi-transparent typographic title defined in MAIN_TITLE_TEXT, rendered in the automatically matched style, floating elegantly in the upper negative space as a primary cultural anchor.\n* Left Side Margin: Displays the clean, small text defined in ENGLISH_SUBTITLE, aligned horizontally beneath the main title using a lightweight, premium editorial serif or geometric sans-serif font that harmonizes with the matched style.\n* Top Right Corner: Features the localized date or blessing statement defined in BLESSING_TEXT_BLOCK, neatly formatted as refined, ultra-lightweight, horizontally running text lines that act as a subtle graphical texture block in the upper right negative space.",
