        "prompt":  "Universal Prompt:\n\nCreate a finished conceptual poster in a vertical 3:4 format.\n\nUse a high-angle aerial perspective looking straight down from above.\n\nThe main composition consists of a large number of repeating 【Group Trees】 arranged in a highly organized, orderly, near-grid formation across the 【Landscape Background】. The repetition should create a strong sense of rhythm, structure, visual pattern, and collective identity.\n\nAt the center of the composition, place one unique 【Outlier Tree】.\n\nThis tree must be clearly different from the surrounding trees through color, species, foliage, bloom, shape, seasonal state, texture, size, orientation, or visual identity. It immediately becomes the focal point of the image.\n\nThe outlier symbolizes individuality, disruption, innovation, resistance, transformation, independence, and breaking away from conformity.\n\nStyle:\n\nModern editorial poster design, conceptual art poster, premium social media visual, gallery-quality graphic design.\n\nBlend realistic natural textures with sophisticated graphic design aesthetics.\n\nInclude:\n\n• subtle paper grain texture\n• soft film noise\n• premium print texture\n• dramatic shadows\n• strong geometric composition\n• elegant negative space\n• high-end color contrast\n• contemporary visual storytelling\n\nTypography Layout:\n\nAt the bottom of the poster, place a huge Chinese title:\n\n「【Chinese Title】」\n\nThe typography should be bold, blocky, oversized, and partially transparent, integrated into the composition.\n\nAbove the title, overlay a handwritten black year:\n\n“2026”\n\nAbove that, add a small English information line:\n\n“AI VISUAL POSTER / CREATIVE SERIES”\n\nAt the bottom, add the English slogan:\n\n“【English Tagline】”\n\nAll typography must be sharp, accurate, readable, and professionally typeset.\n\nAvoid:\n\n* Garbled text\n* Watermarks\n* Logos\n* Advertising style\n* Cartoon aesthetics\n* Collage style\n* Overly complex backgrounds\n\nParameter Options:\n\n【Group Trees】\n\n* Pine Trees\n* Oak Trees\n* Maple Trees\n* Birch Trees\n* Cypress Trees\n* Palm Trees\n* Cherry Blossom Trees\n* Bamboo Groves\n\n【Outlier Tree】\n\n* Golden Tree\n* White Blossom Tree\n* Crimson Maple\n* Black Tree\n* Glowing Bioluminescent Tree\n* Giant Ancient Tree\n* Silver Tree\n* Tree Covered in Flowers\n\n【Landscape Background】\n\n* Dense Forest Floor\n* Autumn Woodland\n* Snow-Covered Valley\n* Green Meadow\n* Desert Plain\n* Mountain Slope\n* Riverside Landscape\n* Minimalist Botanical Garden\n\n【Chinese Title】\n\n* 异类 (The Outlier)\n* 逆生长 (Against Growth)\n* 破林 (Breaking the Forest)\n* 例外 (The Exception)\n* 与众不同 (Different from the Crowd)\n* 独木 (The Lone Tree)\n* 新芽 (New Growth)\n* 破局 (Breaking the Pattern)\n\n【English Tagline】\n\n* 2026 GROWS AGAINST THE FOREST.\n* 2026 STANDS APART.\n* 2026 BREAKS THE PATTERN.\n* 2026 CHOOSES A DIFFERENT ROOT.\n* 2026 REDEFINES GROWTH.\n* 2026 BECOMES THE EXCEPTION.\n* 2026 GROWS BEYOND THE SYSTEM.\n* 2026 CHANGES THE FOREST.",
