        "prompt":  "A cinematic luxury infographic poster celebrating **[Chiangmai]**, designed as a highly detailed collage combining national identity, culture, history, nature, and modern life. The composition features a bold 3D golden title at the top with elegant branding text and a national emblem or coat of arms integrated into the design. The center showcases iconic landmarks, historic architecture, and a prominent cultural statue or figure, surrounded by a mix of old and modern cityscapes.\n\nThe middle section blends natural elements such as mountains, forests, lakes, coastlines, and native wildlife, arranged in a visually balanced, panoramic collage style. The lower section highlights cultural identity through traditional food, crafts, music instruments, textiles, and regional artifacts, alongside modern transportation like trains, buses, or city vehicles.\n\nThe overall style is ultra-detailed, cinematic lighting, high realism, luxury editorial poster design, symmetrical layout, vibrant but natural color grading, and a premium “national identity showcase” aesthetic suitable for travel or cultural promotion.",
