        "prompt":  "Clean, modern typographic travel poster in a **3:2 landscape format**.\n\nThe words **\"CHIANG MAI\"** — large, bold, uppercase geometric sans-serif letters set on a single line (or **\"CHIANG\"** stacked above **\"MAI\"** if better balanced) — span the full width and **ARE the entire composition**.\n\nEvery illustrated element lives **strictly INSIDE the letterforms**, as if each letter is a window cut out of white paper revealing scenes from Chiang Mai; **nothing extends beyond the letter silhouettes.**\n\nOutside the letters: **pure, empty, flat white background** — no objects, no cast shadows, no decoration.\n\n---\n\n## WHAT FILLS EACH LETTER\n*(Authentically representing Chiang Mai, clipped entirely inside the letter shapes.)*\n\n**C** : **Wat Phra That Doi Suthep** — the iconic golden chedi rising elegantly within the curved letter, with hints of sacred temple stairs and naga railings.\n\n**H** : Traditional **Lanna temple rooflines** connected by ornate carved wooden gables spanning the crossbar.\n\n**I** : A tall **Yi Peng sky lantern** floating vertically upward with delicate bamboo framework and glowing paper texture.\n\n**A** : The **Tha Phae Gate** framed symmetrically inside the triangular opening, with subtle ancient brick textures.\n\n**N** : Rolling **Doi Suthep mountain ranges** connected by drifting morning mist crossing diagonally through the letter.\n\n**G** : A graceful **Bo Sang paper umbrella** opening within the circular form, decorated with delicate Northern Thai floral motifs.\n\n**M** : A lively **Chiang Mai Night Bazaar** scene with handcrafted lanterns, market stalls, textiles, and tiny shoppers integrated into the letter\u0027s peaks.\n\n**A** : A traditional **red songthaew** driving beneath Lanna archways with simplified city details.\n\n**I** : A mature **rain tree** and the tranquil **Ping River** reflected beneath, accompanied by a subtle long-tail boat.\n\n---\n\n### Small city details\nOnly where they comfortably fit **inside the letters**:\n\n- tiny Yi Peng lanterns\n- red songthaew\n- Bo Sang umbrellas\n- longan branches\n- coffee cup\n- elephant silhouette\n- temple bells\n- bicycle\n- swallows\n- drifting mountain mist\n- small lotus flowers\n- gentle river reflections\n\nEverything remains fully contained inside the typography while preserving perfect readability of **CHIANG MAI**.\n\n---\n\n## STYLE\n\nElegant flat vector illustration.\n\nCrisp geometric shapes.\n\nMinimal detail.\n\nClean outlines.\n\nSubtle shadows **contained only inside the letters.**\n\nLimited color palette:\n\n- Deep forest green\n- Warm ivory\n- Lanna temple gold\n- Terracotta brick red\n- Soft slate gray\n- Muted sky blue\n\nAccent colors used sparingly:\n\n- Warm lantern gold\n- Songthaew red\n- Umbrella floral colors\n\n---\n\nOptional minimal tagline beneath in widely spaced small capitals:\n\n**ROSE OF THE NORTH**\n\nThin, understated typography centered beneath the main title.\n\n---\n\nPerfectly balanced centered composition.\n\nPremium flat vector.\n\nMinimalist travel poster.\n\nGeometric illustration.\n\nEditorial tourism branding.\n\nClean typography.\n\nHigh contrast.\n\nUltra-sharp vector lines.\n\nMuseum-quality print.\n\nScalable SVG aesthetic.\n\n8K ultra-high resolution.",
