        "prompt":  "USER_INPUT\n\nCampaign Header: WORK CULTURE\n\nCampaign Subtitle: Designing Better Workflows Through Collaboration\n\nBackground Color: Solid dark slate-grey canvas\n\nContrast Palette Colors:\nTerracotta-orange,\nSoft mint-green,\nMatte-white,\nCharcoal-grey\n\nLetter Shapes Text:\nMassive 3D blocks shaped into the word **\"WORK\"**\n\nNarrative Elements:\nInterconnected office walkways, collaborative meeting pods, elevated work platforms, open staircases, glass bridges, laptops, presentation screens, shared worktables, indoor greenery, coffee stations, and directional wayfinding signage.\n\nInhabitant Actions:\nTiny line-art figures walking between workspaces, collaborating around meeting tables, giving presentations, brainstorming with sticky notes, working at desks, relaxing in breakout lounges, carrying laptops, and gathering in collaborative hubs.\n\n---\n\nINSTRUCTIONS\n\nCreate a high-angle, bird\u0027s-eye view isometric 3D architectural infographic poster based strictly on the data and color choices provided in USER_INPUT.\n\nApply a clean 2D vector technical illustration style characterized by sharp geometric layouts, uniform line weights, flat color fills, and absolute zero depth-of-field blur.\n\nThe lighting environment must be completely flat graphic design illumination with uniform directional contrast shading blocks on the 3D facets, producing zero realistic physical cast shadows.\n\n---\n\n## VISUAL LAYOUT STRUCTURE (MODULAR PRESENTATION)\n\n### 1. TYPOGRAPHIC FRAMING (HEADER \u0026 FOOTER)\n\n- Position **USER_INPUT → Campaign Header** in the upper-left corner using clean modern sans-serif typography rendered in solid white.\n- Position **USER_INPUT → Campaign Subtitle** in the upper-right corner using refined tracking and minimalist typography.\n- Place small white sans-serif metadata, project information, icons, and organizational marks along the absolute lower-left baseline.\n\n---\n\n### 2. CENTRAL 3D TYPOGRAPHIC ARCHITECTURE (DYNAMIC PALETTE)\n\n- Position an elaborate architectural megastructure at the center of the composition where enormous interconnected buildings are carefully constructed into the word:\n\n**WORK**\n\n- The surrounding environment remains a seamless canvas using **USER_INPUT → Background Color.**\n- Each architectural volume, staircase, bridge, platform, rooftop terrace, and circulation path is rendered using the contrasting colors defined in **USER_INPUT → Contrast Palette Colors**, creating a visually balanced modular workplace environment.\n\n---\n\n### 3. WORKPLACE, MOVEMENT \u0026 NARRATIVE DETAILS\n\n- Distribute the workplace environments described in **USER_INPUT → Narrative Elements** naturally across the upper, middle, and lower levels of the architectural typography.\n\n- Integrate meeting rooms, collaboration zones, workstations, lounge spaces, presentation areas, indoor plants, cafés, elevators, bridges, and circulation paths directly into the giant letter structures.\n\n- Scatter dozens of tiny white line-art human figures throughout the architectural environment illustrating the exact activities described in **USER_INPUT → Inhabitant Actions**, creating a dynamic narrative of productivity, creativity, communication, innovation, and teamwork.\n\n- Add subtle environmental graphics such as directional arrows, circulation indicators, workspace icons, and architectural navigation markers to reinforce the infographic aesthetic.\n\n---\n\n## LAYOUT BOUNDARIES\n\nThe entire poster layout must remain completely open with absolutely zero outer borders, framing boxes, unnecessary decorative elements, or non-English typography.\n\nThe finished artwork should resemble a premium isometric architectural visualization where the word **WORK** becomes an immersive miniature workplace city, combining editorial infographic design, contemporary architecture, and modern workplace storytelling.",
