        "prompt":  "Create an ultra-premium editorial advertising poster for fresh Avocado, reimagined as an “Avocado Nature Adventure” papercraft world where a single avocado becomes an entire miniature landscape of lush forests, sustainable farming, wellness, and imagination. The image must feel joyful, elegant, immersive, and highly art-directed, combining hyper-real avocado photography with exquisite layered paper-cut storytelling. The avocado must remain the absolute hero object while the miniature nature world unfolds from within it like a vibrant adventure.\n\nUse a clean vertical composition with one single fresh avocado placed exactly at the center of the frame, standing upright with bold iconic presence. The avocado must dominate the composition as the primary storytelling stage. The overall poster should feel immediately recognizable, highly graphic, and world-class in campaign impact.\n\nThe avocado must be rendered with absolute product fidelity:\n\n* authentic dark green textured skin,\n* realistic pear-shaped form,\n* natural organic surface,\n* premium soft reflections,\n* subtle surface imperfections,\n* rich tactile texture,\n* and an exceptionally fresh appearance.\n    The avocado should feel premium, healthy, collectible, and unmistakably real.\n\nThe key visual concept is a miniature Avocado Nature Adventure inside the avocado.\n\nTransform the avocado into a rich miniature papercraft landscape built from layered cut-paper scenes, as if the fruit contains an entire world of nature and sustainable agriculture. The landscape should feel peaceful, vibrant, organic, and story-driven while remaining exceptionally clean and premium.\n\nInclude dimensional paper-cut elements such as:\n\n* avocado orchards,\n* rolling hills,\n* forest trails,\n* wooden boardwalks,\n* eco-friendly farmhouses,\n* bamboo bridges,\n* terraced gardens,\n* rivers,\n* waterfalls,\n* flowering plants,\n* birds,\n* butterflies,\n* clouds,\n* mountains,\n* and elegant paper foliage.\n\nEverything should be arranged harmoniously within the avocado world.\n\nThe papercraft landscape should express:\n\n* freshness,\n* sustainability,\n* healthy living,\n* nature,\n* joyful exploration,\n* harmony,\n* and everyday wellness.\n\nInclude tiny paper-cut characters interacting naturally with the environment:\n\n* harvesting avocados,\n* walking through orchards,\n* cycling along forest paths,\n* crossing wooden bridges,\n* relaxing under avocado trees,\n* tending gardens,\n* enjoying picnics,\n* exploring nature,\n* and celebrating the harvest.\n\nThe narrative should feel alive with gentle movement while remaining refined and uncluttered.\n\nThe avocado must remain visually dominant at all times.\n\nThe papercraft world should emerge from within and around the avocado in elegant sculptural layers but must never overpower the fruit itself. Viewers should recognize the avocado immediately, then discover the hidden miniature world as a delightful second layer.\n\nMaterial treatment of the paper world:\n\n* ultra-clean paper-cut edges,\n* subtle premium paper fiber texture,\n* refined layered shadows,\n* controlled dimensional depth,\n* handcrafted precision,\n* luxury editorial papercraft quality.\n\nThe paper world should resemble a museum-quality handcrafted installation rather than a simple craft project.\n\nBackground\n\nUse an extremely minimal premium studio backdrop with a sophisticated gradient inspired by avocado orchards:\nsoft cream blending into fresh avocado green with gentle golden sunlight tones.\n\nThe background should remain spacious, clean, and elegant while emphasizing the central avocado.\n\nLighting\n\nUse soft premium studio lighting with refined editorial quality.\n\nReveal:\n\n* the rich texture of the avocado skin,\n* delicate paper-cut layers,\n* handcrafted dimensional depth,\n* subtle highlights,\n* clean soft shadows,\n* premium tonal separation.\n\nAvoid harsh contrast, muddy blacks, and visual noise.\n\nColor palette\n\n* avocado green,\n* deep forest green,\n* fresh leaf green,\n* warm cream,\n* natural brown,\n* soft earth tones,\n* subtle golden highlights.\n\nTypography\n\nFollow a minimalist luxury editorial poster layout.\n\nPlace a refined title:\n\nAVOCADO\n\nBelow it, in smaller clean uppercase text:\n\nPREMIUM FRESH AVOCADO\n\nOptionally add an editorial tagline such as:\n\n“A MINIATURE WORLD OF NATURE”\n\nor\n\n“GROWN BY NATURE, CRAFTED BY IMAGINATION”\n\nTypography should feel elegant, restrained, and premium.\n\nMood\n\nJoyful sophistication, natural freshness, sustainable living, editorial storytelling, organic beauty, dimensional papercraft, premium agricultural branding, museum-quality campaign design.\n\nRendering style\n\nHyper-real avocado photography, luxury food advertising, layered papercraft nature storytelling, dimensional handcrafted paper world, photorealistic avocado texture, minimal premium studio background, elegant editorial typography, 8K, world-class campaign quality.\n\nNegative prompt\n\nMessy collage, cheap paper craft, artificial avocado, low-detail paper edges, cluttered background, multiple avocados, plastic-looking texture, muddy shadows, black blotches, noisy dark areas, cartoon rendering, weak product focus, chaotic composition, rough typography, generic fruit advertisement.",
