        "prompt":  "Create an ultra-premium symmetrical 4-panel editorial campaign board for Thai Omelet with Rice (Khao Kai Jeow), reimagined as a “Everyday Comfort Meal” luxury food campaign with four clearly different dining environments. The final result must feel like a world-class culinary brand system: warm, comforting, polished, and highly strategic, with each panel representing a unique eating occasion and lifestyle mood while keeping Khao Kai Jeow as the hero dish in every frame.\n\nOverall layout\n\nUse a clean symmetrical 2×2 grid with four balanced square panels.\n\nEach panel must function as a standalone premium food advertisement, yet all four must feel unified as one campaign through consistent visual identity, lighting quality, typography, and color harmony.\n\nThe grid must feel elegant, commercially intelligent, and visually satisfying.\n\n⸻\n\nHero Dish\n\nThe Khao Kai Jeow must be rendered with absolute culinary realism:\n\n* perfectly fluffy golden Thai omelet\n* beautifully crispy lacy edges\n* soft, moist interior\n* fragrant steamed jasmine rice\n* realistic egg texture\n* delicate oil sheen\n* premium ceramic serving plate\n* authentic Thai presentation\n\nThe dish must appear fresh, comforting, premium, appetizing, and instantly recognizable.\n\n⸻\n\nKey Visual Concept\n\nCreate four distinct dining environments.\n\nEach panel represents a completely different meal experience.\n\nDo not simply recolor the same composition.\n\nThe four panels should clearly communicate four different moments of everyday life.\n\n⸻\n\nPanel 1 — Warm Family Home Lunch\n\nCreate a bright Thai family dining table with soft natural daylight.\n\nInclude supporting elements such as:\n\n* jasmine rice\n* cucumber slices\n* fresh herbs\n* Thai chili fish sauce\n* simple homemade side dishes\n\nThe omelet remains the hero.\n\nMood:\n\nwelcoming,\nfamily warmth,\ncomfort,\ntraditional home cooking.\n\n⸻\n\nPanel 2 — Modern Urban Café\n\nCreate a contemporary café lunch scene.\n\nUse:\n\n* minimalist ceramic tableware\n* clean wooden tabletop\n* iced coffee\n* small fresh salad\n* elegant presentation\n\nThe omelet remains centered.\n\nMood:\n\nmodern,\nstylish,\ncreative,\npremium casual dining.\n\n⸻\n\nPanel 3 — Cozy Weekend Comfort Meal\n\nCreate a relaxed weekend atmosphere.\n\nInclude:\n\n* warm linen\n* handcrafted ceramic plates\n* homemade chili sauce\n* soft afternoon sunlight\n* comforting tabletop styling\n\nThe crispy omelet becomes the visual centerpiece.\n\nMood:\n\nslow living,\ncozy,\nindulgent,\npeaceful.\n\n⸻\n\nPanel 4 — Healthy Active Meal\n\nCreate a nutritious contemporary meal setting.\n\nInclude:\n\n* brown rice or mixed rice option\n* fresh vegetables\n* avocado slices\n* grilled vegetables\n* herbal drink\n* clean modern table styling\n\nThe omelet remains the dominant hero while communicating balanced nutrition.\n\nMood:\n\nhealthy,\nenergetic,\nfresh,\nmodern lifestyle.\n\n⸻\n\nEach panel must differ in:\n\n* table styling\n* lighting direction\n* supporting foods\n* plate presentation\n* surface material\n* emotional atmosphere\n\nThe four dining worlds should communicate:\n\n* family comfort\n* urban modern\n* weekend relaxation\n* healthy lifestyle\n\n⸻\n\nSupporting Styling\n\nUse elegant supporting food only when it reinforces the story:\n\n* steamed jasmine rice\n* cucumber\n* tomatoes\n* herbs\n* chili fish sauce\n* fresh vegetables\n* iced coffee\n* herbal tea\n* handcrafted ceramics\n* linen napkins\n* wooden serving boards\n\nAll supporting elements remain secondary.\n\nNever overcrowd the composition.\n\nDo not turn the campaign into a recipe collage.\n\n⸻\n\nLighting\n\nUse premium commercial studio lighting with refined warm natural tones.\n\nEvery panel should feature:\n\n* crisp highlights on the omelet\n* realistic egg texture\n* delicate crispy edges\n* appetizing food sheen\n* elegant shadows\n* clean tonal separation\n\nLighting should resemble beautiful natural meal-time light while remaining visually consistent across all four panels.\n\nAvoid muddy blacks and heavy shadows.\n\n⸻\n\nBackgrounds and Surfaces\n\nAllow each environment to have its own styling while remaining within one premium visual family.\n\nPossible materials:\n\n* warm teak wood\n* natural oak\n* handcrafted ceramics\n* soft linen\n* light stone\n* contemporary café tabletops\n* modern kitchen surfaces\n\n⸻\n\nColor Palette\n\n* golden egg yellow\n* warm cream\n* toasted brown\n* natural wood\n* ceramic white\n* leafy green\n* tomato red\n* subtle chili accents\n\nOverall mood:\n\nwarm,\ncomforting,\nfresh,\npremium,\neditorial,\nappetizing.\n\n⸻\n\nTypography\n\nUse refined English editorial typography.\n\nMain recurring title:\n\nTHAI OMELET\n\nSupporting title:\n\nKHAO KAI JEOW\n\nPossible panel headlines:\n\n* “HOME COMFORT”\n* “MODERN LUNCH”\n* “WEEKEND MOMENT”\n* “EVERYDAY ENERGY”\n\nOverall campaign line:\n\n“FOUR MOMENTS. ONE COMFORT.”\n\nTypography should feel elegant, timeless, and premium.\n\n⸻\n\nMood\n\nComfort food,\nThai culinary heritage,\neveryday luxury,\nwarm hospitality,\neditorial storytelling,\npremium dining,\ncommercial sophistication.\n\n⸻\n\nRendering Style\n\nHyper-real food photography,\nluxury four-panel editorial campaign,\npremium Thai cuisine advertising,\nfour distinct dining environments,\nelegant commercial typography,\n8K,\nworld-class campaign quality.\n\n⸻\n\nNegative Prompt\n\ngeneric food advertisement,\nrepeated dining scenes,\nidentical table styling,\nmessy food arrangement,\nweak hero dish hierarchy,\ncheap restaurant flyer,\nmuddy shadows,\nblack blotches,\nnoisy lighting,\nrecipe collage,\nrough typography,\ncartoon food,\nplastic-looking ingredients,\nlow-detail omelet.",
