        "prompt":  "Create an ultra-premium four-panel educational campaign board for youth football, developed as the **\"Future Football Stories\"** version. The full image must follow a strict **2×2 layout** and read as one complete, unified editorial poster series rather than four separate designs. The visual system must be locked: the football must not be oversized, and in every panel the football must remain the exact same size, the exact same position relative to the boy, and the exact same perspective. The typography placement logic, title hierarchy, lower information structure, and overall layout must also remain perfectly consistent across all four panels. Only the background color, the boy\u0027s action, and the paper-cut sports environment should change from panel to panel.\n\n## Core concept\n\nThis campaign presents **the joy of learning football** through four energetic childhood moments. In each panel, one realistic football appears as the stable visual anchor near the lower-center area, while above it a premium **2D realistic sticker-style boy** performs a different football action inside a handcrafted cut-paper sports environment. The environments and poses change, but the football, typographic order, and campaign structure remain perfectly fixed, creating the feeling of a true collectible educational poster series.\n\nThe football must feel realistic, premium, and balanced—never oversized or visually overpowering.\n\n---\n\n## Series continuity rules\n\nLock these rules across all four panels:\n\n- identical football size\n- identical football placement\n- identical viewing angle\n- identical camera distance\n- identical lower layout\n- identical title placement\n- identical typography hierarchy\n- identical negative space around the football\n\nThe football acts as the visual anchor throughout the campaign.\n\n---\n\n## 4-panel structure\n\nUse a clean **2×2 campaign board** with four equal panels.\n\nEvery panel follows exactly the same structure:\n\n- small educational icon near the top\n- large cut-paper sports environment\n- one 2D realistic sticker-style boy\n- realistic football in the exact same lower-center position\n- identical headline position\n- identical supporting text placement near the bottom\n\nThe structure should feel disciplined, modern, and consistent.\n\n---\n\n## Football logic\n\nRender one premium FIFA-style football with absolute realism:\n\n- official stitched panels\n- realistic leather texture\n- subtle reflections\n- correct proportions\n- soft natural shadow\n- premium commercial quality\n\nThe football must appear in every panel:\n\n- same size\n- same orientation\n- same perspective\n- same lighting family\n- same location\n\n---\n\n## Panel 1 — Warm-up Training\n\nBackground:\n\nsoft sky blue\n\nPaper-cut environment:\n\n- football cones\n- practice field\n- grass layers\n- clouds\n- training markers\n\nBoy:\n\nhealthy primary-school boy\n\nwearing blue football training kit\n\nperforming light dribbling while approaching the football.\n\n---\n\n## Panel 2 — Powerful Kick\n\nBackground:\n\nbright yellow\n\nPaper-cut environment:\n\n- stadium curves\n- cheering banners\n- dynamic arrows\n- geometric sports graphics\n\nBoy:\n\nwearing a yellow football uniform\n\ncaptured in the moment of kicking the football with strong energy.\n\n---\n\n## Panel 3 — Goal Celebration\n\nBackground:\n\nfresh green\n\nPaper-cut environment:\n\n- goal net\n- trees\n- football field\n- confetti\n- ribbons\n- playful park elements\n\nBoy:\n\nwearing green sportswear\n\ncelebrating after scoring with joyful movement while the football remains in the identical position.\n\n---\n\n## Panel 4 — Championship Dream\n\nBackground:\n\ncoral red\n\nPaper-cut environment:\n\n- trophy silhouettes\n- stars\n- stadium lights\n- abstract victory graphics\n- geometric celebration shapes\n\nBoy:\n\nwearing a red football uniform\n\nperforming a dynamic finishing kick with confident body language.\n\n---\n\n## Boy treatment\n\nAll four boys should be:\n\n- healthy primary-school boys\n- realistic proportions\n- energetic\n- athletic\n- expressive\n- clean hairstyle\n- cheerful facial expressions\n\nThey should appear as premium **2D realistic sticker-cutout figures** with:\n\n- subtle white outline\n- soft drop shadow\n- slight separation from the paper background\n- premium editorial appearance\n\nEach pose must clearly represent a different football activity while belonging to one unified educational sports campaign.\n\n---\n\n## Cut-paper background logic\n\nEvery environment uses layered paper construction with:\n\n- clean cut edges\n- matte paper texture\n- subtle depth\n- elegant shadows\n- minimal geometric composition\n\nMotifs may include:\n\n- football field markings\n- stadium elements\n- ribbons\n- clouds\n- goals\n- cones\n- cheering shapes\n- sports symbols\n\nThe paper world supports the football story without becoming cluttered.\n\n---\n\n## Typography\n\nUse a modern English-led educational typography system that remains perfectly consistent across all four panels.\n\nMain campaign title:\n\n**\"FUTURE FOOTBALL STORIES\"**\n\nSubtitle:\n\n**\"Learning Through Every Kick\"**\n\nPanel captions may vary slightly, but must remain short, elegant, and secondary.\n\nTypography should feel:\n\n- modern\n- spacious\n- editorial\n- premium\n- minimal\n\n---\n\n## Lighting\n\nUse clean commercial daylight.\n\nThe football receives identical premium product lighting in every panel.\n\nThe boys and paper environments receive soft directional light with refined shadows.\n\nEverything should feel bright, polished, and professionally art-directed.\n\n---\n\n## Color direction\n\nFour coordinated backgrounds:\n\n- Sky Blue\n- Bright Yellow\n- Fresh Green\n- Coral Red\n\nThese color worlds distinguish the four football moments while maintaining one unified campaign identity.\n\n---\n\n## Mood\n\neducational, energetic, joyful, playful, editorial, premium, modern, healthy, inspirational, collectible, sporty\n\n---\n\n## Rendering style\n\nultra-premium educational campaign board, 2×2 layout, realistic football in identical size and identical position across every panel, 2D realistic sticker-style school boy performing four football actions, layered cut-paper sports environments, premium editorial typography, clean geometric composition, world-class campaign key visual, 8K\n\n---\n\n## Negative prompt\n\noversized football, inconsistent football size, inconsistent football position, inconsistent typography layout, crowded composition, cartoon proportions, low-detail football, messy paper craft, muddy colors, weak visual hierarchy, childish illustration, poor anatomy, low-end poster design",
