        "prompt":  "Create a premium 4:5 PRODUCT HAS GRAVITY advertising poster for Thong Suk Fried Meatballs (ลูกชิ้นทอดทองสุก) on a clean editorial background.\n\nPlace the authentic, hyper-realistic serving of Thong Suk Fried Meatballs floating at the visual center as a powerful gravitational force, drawing product-related ingredients, crispy crumbs, aromatic steam, wooden skewers, dipping sauce droplets, chili flakes, garlic, coriander leaves, pepper, seasoning particles, and warm golden light into dramatic curved orbital trajectories around the hero dish.\n\nBuild a realistic spatial vortex with warped perspective, radial motion trails, swirling food aromas, floating crispy textures, and gently bent environmental elements, while keeping the hero product perfectly sharp, undistorted, and visually dominant.\n\nCreate a short, bold campaign headline based specifically on the product’s key benefit—its irresistible crispiness, savory aroma, and freshly fried appeal—expressed through a metaphor of gravity, attraction, orbit, magnetic pull, irresistible force, or delicious momentum. The headline should be unique to the product and never use a generic gravity slogan.\n\nSurround the hero product with objects that naturally reinforce the eating experience, such as:\n\n* golden crispy fried meatballs on bamboo skewers\n* shimmering crispy coating fragments\n* premium sweet chili dipping sauce\n* fresh coriander\n* roasted garlic\n* cracked black pepper\n* chili flakes\n* floating sesame seeds\n* aromatic steam ribbons\n* subtle oil droplets\n* warm golden crumbs\n* handcrafted serving paper\n* minimalist food basket\n\nEvery surrounding element should appear naturally drawn into the gravitational field, emphasizing freshness, texture, and irresistible flavor.\n\nUse restrained brand-inspired accents featuring:\n\n* golden fried tones\n* warm amber\n* toasted brown\n* deep chili red\n* fresh herb green\n* creamy ivory\n* charcoal accents\n\nLighting should feature premium cinematic commercial food photography with soft golden highlights, realistic reflections, appetizing shadows, and physically believable motion.\n\nMaintain generous negative space, sophisticated editorial composition, premium global food advertising aesthetics, and a surreal-yet-believable visual narrative.\n\nThe overall feeling should communicate:\n\n* irresistible attraction\n* freshly fried perfection\n* premium street food craftsmanship\n* warmth\n* indulgence\n* bold flavor\n* modern culinary branding\n\nAvoid irrelevant objects, excessive visual clutter, unrealistic food styling, cartoon elements, plastic-looking meatballs, chaotic composition, distorted product shapes, muddy shadows, weak product focus, or generic fast-food advertising.",
